WEBVTT

00:00:59.954 --> 00:01:01.621
100 dollars a month 
on eating out,

00:01:01.621 --> 00:01:04.704
let's focus on what I call
a "frequency budget" instead.

00:01:04.746 --> 00:01:07.163
So instead of focusing
on the amount of money

00:01:07.163 --> 00:01:08.496
that's much harder to track

00:01:08.496 --> 00:01:10.454
and sometimes even impossible to track,

00:01:10.496 --> 00:01:13.121
let's focus on limiting
the number of times

00:01:13.121 --> 00:01:14.454
that you go out to eat.

00:01:14.496 --> 00:01:16.746
You'll have a much easier time saying no

00:01:16.746 --> 00:01:18.288
and tracking your budget.

00:01:18.288 --> 00:01:20.996
Now, I understand
that we are all social humans,

00:01:20.996 --> 00:01:23.163
and eating out is such a social activity.

00:01:23.204 --> 00:01:25.704
And if that's what you're craving,
I have some tips

00:01:25.704 --> 00:01:28.204
to make sure you can hit
two birds with one stone.

00:01:28.246 --> 00:01:29.371
Instead of eating out,

00:01:29.413 --> 00:01:31.288
go and have a picnic with friends,